      "sourceTextSha256": "39108f6856a89e9a340e6d0cbc74022ed5becec21a4058c159cfaac99c77f951",
      "text": "You will get acquainted with the capital of Venezuela — Caracas,\ntake a cable car ride to Ávila National Park and visit the historic Humboldt Hotel,\ntravel to the German settlement Colonia Tovar,\nvisit the Santa Teresa rum estate, famous for producing the best Venezuelan rum,\nexplore Canaima National Park and the world’s highest waterfall — Angel Falls,\nand finish your journey relaxing on the Caribbean island of Margarita.",
