            "textSha256": "35a6228e50fde8f19d6cfc1d5806f74f5514458d9125e08ac814a39d6efab855",
            "text": "take a cable car ride to Ávila National Park and visit the historic Humboldt Hotel,"
          },
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml:w:p[11]",
            "textSha256": "3d31a376729f0dc860899c35cfe8a1da702ec657f4ef4023065b82d9b3497c34",
            "text": "travel to the German settlement Colonia Tovar,"
          },
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml:w:p[12]",
            "textSha256": "32b9cb4f2cb24ed4cd2db1febfc332a55e88d8f47c14eb1db988ce599aae13d8",
            "text": "visit the Santa Teresa rum estate, famous for producing the best Venezuelan rum,"
          },
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml:w:p[13]",
            "textSha256": "abe38a6c89147bbd0d424d7351856b23534e19768fea8d9c2885817c79a8e5bd",
            "text": "explore Canaima National Park and the world’s highest waterfall — Angel Falls,"
